{"product_id":"the-fantastic-undersea-life-of-jacques-cousteau","title":"The Fantastic Undersea Life of Jacques Cousteau","description":"\u003cp\u003eJacques Cousteau was the worldâs ambassador of the oceans. His popular TV series brought whales, otters, and dolphins right into peopleâs living rooms. Now, in this exciting picturebook biography, Dan Yaccarino introduces young readers to the man behind the snorkel.From the first moment he got a glimpse of what lived under the oceanâs waves, Cousteau was hooked. And so he set sail aboard the Calypso to see the sea. He and his team of scientists invented diving equipment and waterproof cameras. They made films and televisions shows and wrote books so they could share what they learned. The oceans were a vast unexplored world, and Cousteau became our guide. And when he saw that pollution was taking its toll on the seas, Cousteau became our guide in how to protect the oceans as well. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:230 x 306  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Dan Yaccarino \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780375844706 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 40\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44723200721049,"sku":"11RG9780375844706","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/a62fac8f3f0bac8f1ec752c7c7c54331.jpg?v=1722931818","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-fantastic-undersea-life-of-jacques-cousteau","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}